      "role": "user",
      "content": "Adams is talking about the patent challenge. He's saying if Nebula finds out about the potential invalidation of our data processing patent, they'll tank the valuation or pull out entirely. Should I mention the legal review to them just to be safe, or do we just keep the focus on the strengths like you said?\n volun no one needs to know unless they ask directly.",
